<!-- SECTION 15A: LEGAL FRAMEWORK -->
<section class="content-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Legal Framework: Registered Office Change</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>S.12:</strong> Registered office requirement. INC-22 for change. Penalty Rs 1,000/day (S.12(9)).</p><p><strong>S.13:</strong> MOA Clause II amendment for inter-state shifts.</p><p><strong>INC-22:</strong> 15 days (within city), 30-60 days (other scenarios).</p><p><strong>INC-23:</strong> RD application for inter-ROC and inter-state.</p><p><strong>Delhi Bifurcation:</strong> MCA 23 Oct 2025, effective 16 Feb 2026. ROC South + Central Delhi.</p><p><strong>RD:</strong> Northern Region-1 for Delhi.</p><p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://mca.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mca.gov.in</a>, Companies Act 2013</p>

